# Augraphy writes these into the CURRENT working directory the first time its default pipeline
# runs (paper texture cache, bundled fonts for its text augmentations): resources it downloads
# and reuses, not anything this repo authors. grid/augraphy_render.py (T11) is meant to be run
# from this directory, which is why they land here.
